[{"h":0.011735121542330251,"text":"6 Read the task below. Then read the email and","x":0.02380951618335285,"w":0.37662338256835942,"y":0.040653813973647979},{"h":0.011735121542330251,"x":0.047619051909898499,"y":0.056580050366052514,"w":0.37012985229492185,"text":"complete gaps A-E with the correct form of the"},{"text":"words from the box.","w":0.15800865173339843,"h":0.010174417935393087,"x":0.047619053390154951,"y":0.071220930591411991},{"y":0.09723386402890144,"h":0.011777763894297744,"text":"Your friend is going to visit the English city where","w":0.38311687469482425,"x":0.047619055661245822},{"h":0.011735121542330251,"text":"you stayed as an exchange student last year. The","y":0.11190276618029504,"w":0.37878787994384766,"x":0.04761905335419428},{"text":"family you stayed with have agreed that your friend","w":0.40043289184570313,"h":0.013110635666315651,"x":0.047619055249587025,"y":0.12645348820364888},{"h":0.011791165296709649,"x":0.04761905821535823,"y":0.14244186074200049,"text":"can stay with them during his\/her visit. They have","w":0.38311687469482419},{"x":0.047619065135934696,"y":0.15697674442941068,"w":0.3722943496704102,"h":0.013182517768751123,"text":"never met before. Write an email to the family's"},{"x":0.047619058077397795,"h":0.013176426004184338,"y":0.17141659686291655,"text":"teenage son\/daughter. Include and develop these","w":0.38528137207031249},{"w":0.054112553596496575,"h":0.011627906326076465,"y":0.18750000017998503,"text":"points:","x":0.049783549798072056},{"x":0.047619051710717598,"y":0.20494186067941067,"w":0.2770562744140625,"h":0.013081394716760064,"text":"• Say briefly how you met your friend"},{"x":0.04761906388372765,"y":0.21947674448391652,"text":"• Describe your friend's appearance and personality.","w":0.38961036682128902,"h":0.013130128833294341},{"text":"• Mention some of the things your friend wants to do","x":0.047619043159861402,"y":0.23386420783661677,"w":0.3939393997192383,"h":0.013411567876644659},{"text":"during his\/her stay.","x":0.064935069105846843,"y":0.24999999987718835,"w":0.13636363029479981,"h":0.01162790712546824},{"x":0.047619046252367347,"h":0.013156932437509816,"w":0.39177490234375001,"text":"• Thank the family for agreeing to let your friend stay","y":0.26445934627261436},{"h":0.010304972991559636,"y":0.28045797860396293,"x":0.062752184465327404,"w":0.080123338699340824,"text":"with them."},{"text":"bit can particular sort tend","w":0.27513420104980468,"y":0.31098544531288708,"h":0.01513282251477932,"x":0.062697792246127551},{"x":0.036796537466865689,"h":0.013137439270531126,"text":"Hi Amy,","y":0.35750209564493673,"w":0.056277055740356449},{"h":0.013081394716760064,"text":"I hope you're fine. I'd like to tell you a few things about","y":0.39098837233638739,"x":0.036796555055762854,"w":0.40692638397216796},{"y":0.40552325605731765,"text":"Imogen - the girl who's going to stay with you this","w":0.37229434967041014,"h":0.013169115966643385,"x":0.036796551831461528},{"h":0.0087209295447094881,"text":"summer.","x":0.036796538234818543,"w":0.067099566459655757,"y":0.42296511662299419},{"text":"Imogen and I met in the playground when we were","y":0.44331395374103155,"x":0.03679653853183748,"w":0.37662338256835937,"h":0.011627906326076465},{"y":0.45766974001004956,"x":0.038961042722363483,"h":0.011807004044461555,"text":"children. First, I wasn't A","w":0.17532466888427736},{"h":0.011807003644765834,"y":0.45766974007059802,"text":"nice to her, but","x":0.30952381237384752,"w":0.11471860885620117},{"w":0.22727272033691406,"h":0.013126474014371836,"x":0.036796540949869082,"y":0.47233864216668264,"text":"later we became great friends."},{"w":0.3419913482666016,"text":"When you get to the airport, look for a tall and","y":0.49413243926314432,"x":0.03896103240349582,"h":0.013135002324886846},{"x":0.15151515037105517,"text":"too slim girl with long dark hair and big","w":0.29653678894042967,"h":0.011743649852845484,"y":0.51005867545166561},{"x":0.038961043415072769,"w":0.20779220581054686,"h":0.013411567476948827,"y":0.52305113145002269,"text":"blue eyes. A girl who looks C."},{"w":0.1060606002807617,"x":0.33116883229107658,"text":"of casual but","y":0.52470930278133454,"h":0.010174417935392976},{"x":0.038961040397320304,"y":0.53924418634438165,"w":0.35930736541748048,"h":0.01314474930807219,"text":"fashionable at the same time - that's Imogen O."},{"text":"She is a cool, easy-going girl, and the kind of person","y":0.56104651187127119,"x":0.038961047003237145,"w":0.38311687469482425,"h":0.013136220597861015},{"x":0.038961043715941772,"y":0.57544006715205565,"text":"who 'looks \/ feels good in her own skin. But sometimes","w":0.41341991424560548,"h":0.013411567476948938},{"x":0.036796536832807807,"text":"she","w":0.030303030014038078,"h":0.011627906326076465,"y":0.59156976762184554},{"text":"D","h":0.0087209303441011521,"w":0.010822510719299315,"y":0.60465116266225183,"x":0.038961039147926098},{"text":"be a bit shy and reserved, especially in","x":0.14285714707667752,"y":0.6060352054499718,"w":0.28571428298950197,"h":0.013150840672943032},{"x":0.038961040904665172,"y":0.62196144169744949,"h":0.010477787091366264,"w":0.11255411148071287,"text":"new situations."},{"x":0.036796547029067594,"y":0.64082145840994786,"w":0.40692638397216796,"h":0.017608774477757994,"text":"Imogen's always 'enjoyed \/ been enjoying fashion, so"},{"text":"she's coming to the UK to visit some design schools and","y":0.65842414077735034,"w":0.41125541687011713,"h":0.011735121542330251,"x":0.038961032041131924},{"w":0.39177486419677732,"h":0.011627906326076465,"x":0.038961057647282221,"text":"check the trendiest places. So maybe you could show","y":0.67296511653172919},{"y":0.68734283302236809,"w":0.31168830871582032,"h":0.011785073532142865,"text":"her what's 3in \/ at fashion in London now?","x":0.038961045642089687},{"x":0.036796533583392625,"y":0.70913663000819849,"h":0.014700579423416849,"w":0.41558441162109377,"text":"Thank you again for letting Imogen stay with you. I know"},{"text":"how great it is to stay with a British family, and I'm sure","y":0.7252906980360897,"x":0.038961047719029127,"w":0.40909088134765625,"h":0.011627906326076465},{"text":"you'll have a great time. Just be careful - she","x":0.038961043819897088,"h":0.011735121542330251,"y":0.73973176864809298,"w":0.32900432586669925},{"y":0.75436046516867539,"x":0.13852814245601899,"w":0.11038960456848143,"text":"to talk a lot ©","h":0.014709107334236138},{"x":0.038961055364417553,"y":0.77616279103793773,"text":"Write soon, so we don't 4lose \/ drop touch.","w":0.32034629821777338,"h":0.013081394716760064},{"w":0.043546075820922847,"x":0.037874965085813644,"text":"Love,","y":0.81027211202169369,"h":0.012795464291056935},{"w":0.028138527870178225,"x":0.038961039329701651,"y":0.82848837197021163,"text":"Ella","h":0.01162790712546824},{"x":0.028138527283306621,"text":"7 Read the email again. Choose the correct answers in","y":0.86627906963494039,"h":0.01175948860059739,"w":0.42640693664550777},{"y":0.88226744175179384,"text":"1-4.","h":0.01017441873478464,"w":0.034632034301757805,"x":0.051948052459510702},{"y":0.049418604514508413,"text":"SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT","x":0.50865801416180201,"w":0.26190475463867191,"h":0.011771672129730959},{"x":0.49999999563413683,"h":0.013081394716760064,"text":"8 You and your friend have decided to stay with","y":0.074127907336387411,"w":0.37878787994384761},{"x":0.51948052536229516,"text":"your English-speaking cousin in the countryside for","h":0.013181299495776955,"y":0.088662790941038572,"w":0.39826839447021478},{"text":"a week's holiday abroad. Write an email to your","h":0.013177644277158507,"w":0.3722943496704102,"x":0.52164503761068215,"y":0.1031014250834017},{"y":0.11773255842853148,"h":0.011772890003009295,"w":0.32251079559326179,"text":"cousin. Include and develop these points:","x":0.52164503913518712},{"w":0.37445888519287107,"x":0.51948051785810978,"h":0.013191046478962187,"text":"• Tell him\/her about your friend and how you met.","y":0.13517441887708515},{"h":0.013167897693669217,"x":0.51948051283238528,"y":0.14962279970831549,"w":0.35930736541748043,"text":"• Describe your friend's appearance, personality"},{"text":"and why you like him\/her.","h":0.013081394716759953,"w":0.19047618865966787,"x":0.5346320323656929,"y":0.16424418643522465},{"x":0.51731602027069157,"h":0.013173989458236113,"w":0.35281383514404296,"y":0.17877907010770522,"text":"• Say what you would like to do when you visit"},{"w":0.093073587417602632,"x":0.53463203901125633,"y":0.19476744217086939,"text":"your cousin.","h":0.010178073154011424},{"w":0.35281383514404296,"h":0.013411567476948827,"text":"• Thank your cousin and his family for agreeing","y":0.20620285001428229,"x":0.51948053272559747},{"w":0.22943721771240233,"h":0.013139875416783631,"x":0.534632041360249,"y":0.22087175201063702,"text":"to let you both stay for a week"},{"x":0.51082251720246818,"text":"SHOW THAT YOU'VE CHECKED","y":0.53633720954568975,"w":0.27056276321411132,"h":0.013117945703856604},{"text":"Finished? Always check your writing.","y":0.56104651195324073,"x":0.5086580147823051,"h":0.011627906326076576,"w":0.28571428298950197},{"y":0.57544006725219388,"x":0.5064935018500788,"h":0.011769234784390847,"text":"Can you tick \/ everything on this list?","w":0.29220779418945309},{"h":0.012419358882600262,"x":0.50422933795859481,"y":0.59698799466735963,"text":"In my email:","w":0.099766435623168892},{"h":0.013081394716760064,"y":0.62063953541778283,"text":"• I have started with a friendly greeting, e.g.","w":0.33116882324218755,"x":0.50865801453330728},{"h":0.010257266493075456,"x":0.52597402699118601,"text":"Dear James or Hi Gemma.","w":0.19696969985961921,"y":0.63517441852141576},{"w":0.22727272033691404,"text":"• I have said why I am writing.","y":0.65697674452630994,"x":0.5064935061735345,"h":0.013182517768751123},{"y":0.68021793788995277,"w":0.29220779418945309,"h":0.013096015191537802,"x":0.5086580113197755,"text":"• I have described how I met my friend"},{"w":0.32034629821777338,"h":0.013192264751936356,"x":0.50865802506138724,"y":0.70348837243328666,"text":"• I have described my friend's appearance,"},{"w":0.18614717483520504,"text":"personality and interests.","y":0.71793797140628257,"x":0.52380953132698627,"h":0.011735121542330251},{"y":0.73973176872116209,"text":"• I have thanked the family and the addressee.","w":0.35064933776855467,"x":0.50865802094256229,"h":0.01317520773121017},{"y":0.76308139588289914,"h":0.013113071812568156,"x":0.50649351251310537,"text":"• I have used contractions (e.g. I'm \/ aren't \/","w":0.33116882324218744},{"w":0.04761904716491705,"x":0.52597402679632932,"h":0.010174418734784751,"y":0.77761627898653207,"text":"that's)."},{"w":0.3441558456420899,"h":0.013081395516151728,"text":"• I have perhaps used some emoticons © and","y":0.80087209285481187,"x":0.50865801078285111},{"w":0.3181818008422852,"h":0.013176426004184338,"text":"abbreviations (info \/ CU \/ gr8) - but not too","y":0.81540697700571874,"x":0.52380953645656292},{"x":0.52380952324293839,"y":0.83139534924451286,"w":0.047619047164916939,"text":"many!","h":0.010174417935392976},{"w":0.32731315612792966,"h":0.015510498328260902,"y":0.84983730317970807,"x":0.50845436710845182,"text":"• I have finished with a friendly ending, e.g."},{"y":0.86627907024699802,"h":0.013081394716759953,"x":0.52597402886585054,"w":0.29870128631591797,"text":"Bye 4 now, All the best, Lots of love, etc"},{"w":0.34848484039306638,"h":0.013411567476948827,"y":0.88935456842108074,"text":"• I have checked my spelling and punctuation.","x":0.50865801851198034},{"y":0.91279069814510128,"text":"• My text is neat and clear.","w":0.20129869461059569,"h":0.011769234784390958,"x":0.5086580104598537},{"y":0.62645348815801638,"h":0.014534883906835327,"w":0.021645021438598588,"x":0.90476190475689122,"text":"C"},{"y":0.85901162815034104,"x":0.90692640721410245,"text":"U","h":0.013081394716759953,"w":0.019480519294738707},{"y":0.888081395437